Video production tools for editing footage, compositing motion graphics,
preparing still images and audio, transcoding media, and inspecting and
previewing the results.

The default suite combines FilmCraft, EffectCraft, PhotoCraft, SoundCraft,
FFmpeg, MediaInfo, and mpv. Audacity, Kdenlive, and VectorCraft are optional.
Craft applications can be deselected individually.

Each application retains its own license and distribution terms. The
FilmCraft and EffectCraft recipes apply ArtCraft brand restrictions that
prohibit mirroring or selling their packages, so these dependencies require
local source builds. This meta port bundles no application code or assets.
